      "titleZh": "超越LoRA：你能击败最流行的微调技术吗？",
      "titleEn": "Beyond LoRA: Can you beat the most popular fine-tuning technique?",
      "summaryZh": "Hugging Face 发布了一篇关于微调技术的文章，探讨了 LoRA 的局限性以及可能的替代方案。文章指出，虽然 LoRA 因其高效性而广受欢迎，但在某些任务上可能不如全参数微调。作者提出了一些实验性方法，并邀请社区参与挑战，以寻找更优的微调策略。",
      "summaryEn": "Hugging Face published an article on fine-tuning techniques, exploring the limitations of LoRA and possible alternatives. The article notes that while LoRA is popular for its efficiency, it may underperform full fine-tuning on certain tasks. The author proposes experimental methods and invites the community to participate in a challenge to find better fine-tuning strategies.",
